00:00:32.635 --> 00:00:33.635
- Oh my god.

00:00:35.063 --> 00:00:39.353
Please welcome singer,
songwriter, Sam DeRosa, ya'll.

00:00:39.353 --> 00:00:42.520
(boisterous applause)

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:51.719
(applause drowns out voices)

00:00:55.313 --> 00:00:56.771
- Come on in.

00:00:56.771 --> 00:00:57.604
- How are you?

00:00:57.604 --> 00:00:58.437
(mumbles)

00:00:58.437 --> 00:00:59.387
- Patricia Heaton.

00:00:59.387 --> 00:01:00.787
- Nice to meet you.

00:01:00.787 --> 00:01:02.040
- Hi, I'm Sam.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.060
- Okay.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.060
- Woo, I'm already crying.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:05.860
- Okay, well, first of all, welcome.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:06.990
Secondly, I was not kidding.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:08.320
I don't know if you read
the card back there,

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.810
but my sister, because it was the pilot,

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:13.220
I guess they kept showing sneak previews

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:14.440
of songs or something.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:15.930
My sister has been all over me

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.930
and I kept forgetting to ask Shane.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.990
She loves your song "Pill for This".

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:21.350
She was like, where's the girl,

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.330
and then it didn't even,
I just want the song.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:25.230
She was just so glad it came it out.

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:26.063
And she literally said,

00:01:26.063 --> 00:01:27.450
"I don't want somebody else to sing it.

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.300
I want her to sing it."

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:29.180
- And that's what we got.

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:30.150
So, that was amazing.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.630
- Yes.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
So are you kind of happy
that you didn't win

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:36.340
and it's all, I'm being serious.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:39.450
Like you didn't win and it's
all unfolding beautifully.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.960
- Honestly, I feel like I won.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:43.793
Do you know what I mean?

00:01:43.793 --> 00:01:48.480
Sometimes I feel like there's
no right way all the time

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:49.313
to do things.

00:01:49.313 --> 00:01:50.146
There's no perfect way

00:01:50.146 --> 00:01:51.900
and my whole life has been a series

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.670
of being told there's a door

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.700
and me finding my way in through a window.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.830
Really, has been forever and I've--

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:58.663
- There's a song.

00:01:58.663 --> 00:01:59.860
- Get it, get it.

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:02.292
- And you know what,
we're sitting right here.

00:02:02.292 --> 00:02:03.410
- Do you want to sing it?

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:05.320
- I just want to be a part in the room.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.450
I don't have to be a part
of any one word, one third.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:08.870
I just want to be there.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.150
No, it's fun to write with him.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.564
He's incredible as well.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:12.530
- He really is.

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:13.873
- He really is.

00:02:13.873 --> 00:02:14.706
- [Kelly] He really is.

00:02:14.706 --> 00:02:15.940
I'm amazing and I love awards.

00:02:16.815 --> 00:02:17.648
(laughs)

00:02:17.648 --> 00:02:18.684
- I saw that.

00:02:18.684 --> 00:02:19.517
It said I love trophy.

00:02:19.517 --> 00:02:20.750
- I know he's awesome.

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.404
- Look at my little trophy.

00:02:22.404 --> 00:02:23.449
(boisterous laughter)

